  "id": "brain-based-learning",
  "term": "brain-based learning",
  "definition": "Brain-based learning is an approach to teaching that aims to apply research on the brain, especially findings about learning and memory, to classroom practice. In the source, it is described as an area of strong interest in schools but one that is often mixed with neuroscience misconceptions, or neuromyths.",
